      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burns_Harbor%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Burns Harbor borders the Indiana Dunes, an area that conservationists have fought hard to preserve for its unique sand dunes and wildlife.",
